{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/383846-kickstarter-as-a-gift","id":383846,"title":"Kickstarter as a gift.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-27T17:49:56-08:00","id":383846,"title":"Kickstarter as a gift.","content":"Is it ok to list myself as a backer for a kickstarter, if a relative bought the kickstarter at my request and is emailing me the survey to do myself?<br /> <br /> Wheres the icon for wraiths kickstarter if I may ask?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T18:12:06-08:00","id":383857,"title":"","content":"Ah, the uncertainty of signs. What makes a backer a backer? The intention and interest was yours, but the money was theirs. Both are required for backing to take place, but are either sufficient alone?<br /> <br /> To actually answer your question, did you pay your relative back for the money they put out? If so, then it's you who backed all the way. Otherwise, the backing occurred as a collaboration between you and your relative, so just them if they're cool with it. Since they're sending you the survey, they don't seem to attached anyway. If they're not cool with it... well, I'd say you both have equal part in it, but neither is actually a full backer. Kickstarter would certainly consider your relative the backer, though, since they're the one they got record for forking over the money.<br /> <br /> Bottom line, unless you'll get into trouble with your relative, it's not like anyone's gonna call you on it. The discussion is interesting but ultimately academic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Dex Davican wrote:</b> I can say without exaggeration or dishonesty that I am the most creative man <i>ever to have lived</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/75-weimann","name":"Weimann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar75_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1279"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T18:28:22-08:00","id":383863,"title":"","content":"The Demon: the Descent corebook that got Kickstartered includes among its contributor list &quot;kawaii kawaii kawaii GRENTOK, THE FUCKING DESTROYER OF WORLDS&quot; so I'm pretty sure the team are happy to include whatever name the contributor consents to including.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T19:20:35-08:00","id":383885,"title":"","content":"It shouldn't matter as they actually ask in the survey what name you want to be displayed in the backer section. For instance the last couple of ones I've backed I've had my real name with my forum name.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T19:34:26-08:00","id":383897,"title":"","content":"They bought it for me as a Christmas Gift.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-27T19:52:45-08:00","id":383913,"title":"","content":"I think I've used different names for all the books I backed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T08:02:16-08:00","id":384223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/383846-kickstarter-as-a-gift?p=383897#post383897\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They bought it for me as a Christmas Gift.</div> </div> </div> </div>Again, it <i>doesn't</i> matter. The survey <i>asks</i> what name the backer wants put in the book. A backer doesn't have to put their name, in fact some have only used nicknames and forum names rather than real names. In fact the person that bought the backing as a gift for you doesn't need to email you the survey, all they need to do is put your name in the part of the survey that asks for the name that will be put in the backers. Because basically all the survey asks is the name for the backer section, how much was spent, if you also bought any add-ons and if so, which ones, all of which can be handled by the person who bought it for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T09:43:37-08:00","id":384293,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/383846-kickstarter-as-a-gift?p=384223#post384223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Again, it <i>doesn't</i> matter. The survey <i>asks</i> what name the backer wants put in the book. A backer doesn't have to put their name, in fact some have only used nicknames and forum names rather than real names. In fact the person that bought the backing as a gift for you doesn't need to email you the survey, all they need to do is put your name in the part of the survey that asks for the name that will be put in the backers. Because basically all the survey asks is the name for the backer section, how much was spent, if you also bought any add-ons and if so, which ones, all of which can be handled by the person who bought it for you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, this.<br /> <br /> W20 was backed by my Shadowlord Galliard, Jason Saroff, who was too awesome for Deed Names.<br /> CB20 was backed by Jiao River-Dragon, my Zhao Lung Sai Chao, Seer Pro Tempore of the Court of the Jade Wolf<br /> BotW20 was backed by Eats-the-Wolves, whose Wyrm name was &quot;I fell to the Wyrm and Danced the Black Spiral and all I got was this stupid Name&quot;, who had more derangements than anyone else in the Pack, but they kinda canceled each other out, so he was the only one with the fortitude to kill our captives when they ran out of useful information to torture them for.<br /> Earthdawn Fourth Edition was backed by Empress Alaria Festryl of Urupa, Eleven Thief, owner of the Gift of Theft, Restorer of House Festryl.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-28T13:59:45-08:00","id":384475,"title":"","content":"I have variously backed Kickstarters as:<br /> <br /> The Letter E<br /> Balsamic Vinegar<br /> Your Mother<br /> semicasual<br /> (My actual name)<br /> JC Denton<br /> <br /> ...and some others. I try to make up a new name for each one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>On the frontier of the Wild South, there's only one woman with the grit to take on its most dangerous outlaws and bring them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/984977-back-alive-or-maybe-dead-quest\" target=\"_blank\">Back Alive, or Maybe Dead.</a><br /> <br /> Avatar by <a href=\"http://puzzlinghappenstance.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">K.S. Brenowitz</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/908-semicasual","name":"semicasual","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar908_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2499"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}